<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CV - Sigui Kessé Emmanuel</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 0;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12mm 15mm;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #4f46e5;
        }
        .hero-table {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .hero-row {
            display: table-row;
        }
        .hero-title-cell {
            display: table-cell;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .hero-info-cell {
            display: table-cell;
            vertical-align: middle;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .name {
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .name span {
            color: #818cf8;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .container {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0 12mm;
            margin-top: 6mm;
        }
        .main-row {
            display: table-row;
        }
        .left-col {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 66%;
            padding-right: 8mm;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .right-col {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 34%;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-left: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            padding: 4mm 5mm;
            vertical-align: top;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            border-bottom: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
            position: relative;
        }
        h2::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -1.5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 30px;
            height: 1.5px;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
        }
        .profile-text {
            color: #475569;
            text-align: justify;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .item {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .item-header {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }
        .item-meta {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #4f46e5;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }
        .item-meta span {
            color: #64748b;
            float: right;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 12px;
            color: #475569;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .project-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .project-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
        }
        .project-desc {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #475569;
            margin: 2px 0 0 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .skill-section {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .skill-title {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e1b4b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #eef2ff;
            color: #4338ca;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            margin: 0 2px 4px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #e0e7ff;
        }
        .tag-dark {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .edu-item {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .edu-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0f172a;
        }
        .edu-meta {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-table">
            <div class="hero-row">
                <div class="hero-title-cell">
                    <div class="name">Sigui Kessé <span>Emmanuel</span></div>
                    <div class="subtitle">Architecte Logiciel Senior &amp; Ingénieur Plateforme</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-info-cell">
                    emmanuel.sigui@gmail.com<br>
                    github.com/siguici<br>
                    npmjs.com/~siguici<br>
                    Abidjan, Côte d'Ivoire
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="main-row">
            
            <div class="left-col">
                <h2>Profil Professionnel</h2>
                <div class="profile-text">
                    Architecte logiciel et ingénieur plateforme senior cumulant plus de 10 ans d'expérience. Expert dans la modélisation d'architectures distribuées hautement résilientes (DDD, Clean, Hexagonale) et le développement d'outils de performance critiques cross-runtime (Node.js, Deno, Bun).
                </div>

                <h2>Expériences Clés</h2>
                
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-header">Co-fondateur &amp; Lead Developer</div>
                    <div class="item-meta">Glaxuss Tech <span>Depuis 2024</span></div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Arbitrage et modélisation d'architectures découplées complexes (SOLID, DDD).</li>
                        <li>Conception d'architectures logicielles cross-runtime natives unifiant Node.js, Deno et Bun.</li>
                        <li>Orchestration des infrastructures de haute disponibilité cloud et pipelines CI/CD.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-header">Ingénieur Logiciel &amp; Consultant Senior</div>
                    <div class="item-meta">Consulting Indépendant &amp; Open Source <span>2016 - 2024</span></div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Mainteneur actif et contributeur reconnu des écosystèmes majeurs <strong>Qwik</strong> et <strong>Astro</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Intégration d'APIs financières et synchronisation de flux transactionnels <strong>Moov Money</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Automatisation avancée des tâches via <code>justfile</code> et pipelines GitHub Actions.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <h2>Réalisations &amp; Projets</h2>
                
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-title">Phi — Langage de Programmation &amp; Superset PHP</div>
                    <div class="project-desc">Conception d'un superset de PHP écrit en <strong>Vlang</strong>. Spécification de la grammaire, REPL interactif et gestion stricte des erreurs via l'usage exclusif de blocs natifs <code>or</code>.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-title">Mélanoderme — Écosystème Multi-Vendeur</div>
                    <div class="project-desc">Plateforme e-commerce d'envergure gérant des flux de distribution et des architectures de données complexes.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-title">Complexe Hôtelier Mawla Kiélé</div>
                    <div class="project-desc">Spécifications techniques d'un domaine de 4 hectares avec PWA iOS optimisée pour Safari.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="right-col">
                <h2>Expertise Technique</h2>
                
                <div class="skill-section">
                    <div class="skill-title">Architectures</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">DDD</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">Clean Architecture</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">Hexagonale</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">SOLID</div>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-section">
                    <div class="skill-title">Runtimes &amp; Langages</div>
                    <div class="tag">Node.js</div>
                    <div class="tag">Deno</div>
                    <div class="tag">Bun</div>
                    <div class="tag">Vlang</div>
                    <div class="tag">PHP / Laravel</div>
                    <div class="tag">Symfony</div>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-section">
                    <div class="skill-title">Front-end &amp; UI</div>
                    <div class="tag">TALL Stack</div>
                    <div class="tag">TailwindCSS</div>
                    <div class="tag">Alpine.js</div>
                    <div class="tag">Livewire</div>
                    <div class="tag">Qwik</div>
                    <div class="tag">Astro</div>
                    <div class="tag">htmx</div>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-section">
                    <div class="skill-title">Automation</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">GitHub Actions</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">Just (Runner)</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">Typst</div>
                    <div class="tag tag-dark">Docker</div>
                </div>

                <h2>Cursus Éducatif</h2>
                <div class="edu-item">
                    <div class="edu-title">Master 1 Big Data &amp; Data Science</div>
                    <div class="edu-meta">2022 - 2023</div>
                </div>
                <div class="edu-item">
                    <div class="edu-title">Licence Business Intelligence</div>
                    <div class="edu-meta">2019 - 2022</div>
                </div>

                <h2>Langues</h2>
                <div class="edu-item">
                    <div class="edu-title">Français</div>
                    <div class="edu-meta">Langue maternelle / Bilingue</div>
                </div>
                <div class="edu-item">
                    <div class="edu-title">Anglais</div>
                    <div class="edu-meta">Technique &amp; Professionnel</div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
